3,1,,status,Midori,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Benjamin,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,May,,Let's not repeat the same mistakes. I want to see what actually happened in the past before we get too excited.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A prudent start, May. I'm curious if the plans assume a magical workforce. I'll be looking into the human element.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,I agree with being careful. I'm worried we might be fixing the loudest complaints rather than the biggest delays. I want real data.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is always lovely to see such diligence. I worry about the hidden hurdles and who must sign off on these dreams.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I am concerned about the long-term obligations. Headline figures often hide the true cost of future commitments.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, staffing is one thing, but knowing why previous staffing plans failed is another. History is the best teacher here.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,Quite right. Though history is often written by those who didn't have to work the late shift.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shizue, if we can find where the minutes are actually lost, we can make the most of the budget.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"That is a wonderful point, Midori. I shall look into the committee minutes to see who holds the keys to approval.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I will be looking into the contractor fees. We must ensure we aren't signing away our future to external vendors.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,May,,"I'll stick to my guns. I'm diving into the archives to see if these ""new"" ideas are just recycled failures.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I shall focus on the roster books. It would be a tragedy to promise a service that no one is available to drive.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Midori,,I'll look into the journey audits and the timed runs. I want to see the gap between perception and reality.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I also wonder what the old shells are hiding. It would be a shame to start digging and find a surprise we cannot afford.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I also want to see the capital ledger. I need to know if the balances are as stable as they appear on paper.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
